    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>You decide which side of you is the wall.</em></p><p><strong>Reaction.</strong> When a creature within <strong>1 square</strong> of you attempts to move past you (toward an adjacent square that would put you between them and their previous position), you may spend <strong>1 Ruin Charge</strong> as a reaction. Their movement <strong>simply ends</strong> in their current square — no attack roll, no defense check. They have not yet spent the movement and may use it to retreat or move along a different path next turn.</p><p>Limit: <strong>once per target per encounter</strong>. The same creature cannot be Denied a second time in the same encounter, but may move past once Denial has resolved on a different opponent.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
